# Backend Overview (Supabase self-hosted)

## Domains
- API Gateway: https://api.freezer.andreasgoessl.de
- Studio: https://studio.freezer.andreasgoessl.de

## Storage
- Bucket: photos (private)

## Key Tables
- categories (emoji, freezer_months)
- locations
- products (EAN)
- freezer_units
- device_tokens
- notifications_sent

## View
- v_units_display (due_date/days_left/display_name/category fallback)

## Attention / Fällig
- daily job at 10:00:
  - sets/clears attention_reason based on due_date (mhd_2/mhd_7)
  - sends summary push to all device tokens (APNs)
